@{
    Layout = "_PublicLayout";
}

<div class="policy-head">
  <div class="ph-label">About WorkLog</div>
  <h1>Simple work tracking,<br>powered by AI.</h1>
  <p class="ph-meta">Built for developers, freelancers, and small teams who care about their time.</p>
</div>

<div class="policy-body">

  <div class="about-feature-grid">
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">⚡</div>
      <div class="af-title">Log in seconds</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Type naturally — "3h on API gateway rate limiting" — and WorkLog parses it automatically. Or use voice input for hands-free logging.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">🤖</div>
      <div class="af-title">AI-powered insights</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Powered by Ollama running locally on your machine. Get daily summaries, improve descriptions, and parse natural language into structured entries — all without sending data to the cloud.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">📊</div>
      <div class="af-title">Timesheets &amp; exports</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Generate weekly or monthly timesheets in seconds. Export to CSV for payroll, invoicing, or sharing with your manager.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">↺</div>
      <div class="af-title">Recurring entries</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Set up templates for work you do every day — standups, code reviews, meetings — and WorkLog auto-logs them each morning when you open the app.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">🔥</div>
      <div class="af-title">Streak &amp; insights</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Stay consistent with a daily logging streak. See weekly hour trends, your most active project, and a gentle reminder if you forget to log after 4 PM.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">🔒</div>
      <div class="af-title">Private by default</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Your data lives in your own database. The AI runs locally. Nothing is sent to third-party servers unless you choose to export.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Built with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>ASP.NET Core 8</strong> — fast, cross-platform web framework</li>
    <li><strong>Entity Framework Core</strong> — data persistence with SQL Server</li>
    <li><strong>Ollama</strong> — local AI inference (llama3.2 model)</li>
    <li><strong>Web Speech API</strong> — browser-native voice input</li>
    <li><strong>Inter</strong> — beautiful open-source typeface by Rasmus Andersson</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who is it for?</h2>
  <p>WorkLog is designed for anyone who needs to track how they spend their working hours: freelancers billing by the hour, developers keeping project logs, employees submitting weekly timesheets, or teams wanting visibility into what everyone is working on.</p>
  <p>It's intentionally minimal — no project management overhead, no tickets, no boards. Just you and a daily record of what you did.</p>

  <h2>Open source</h2>
  <p>WorkLog is a personal project built with care. If you have feedback, bug reports, or feature ideas, use the <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">Contact</a> page to get in touch.</p>

</div>
